{"ancestors": "0,69", "bizKey": "9032595", "createBy": null, "createTime": "2023-08-06 15:09:49", "detail": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>一、支付设备介绍</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(6, 6, 7); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14px;\">支付设备是指用于处理电子支付的各种硬件和软件工具，如POS机、ATM机、移动支付设备、电子钱包、芯片和PIN终端、在线支付网关以及NFC支付系统，它们使交易更快捷、安全。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2024/09/05/5b1f72e8-fe2b-468f-8102-fe8e55dff3d8-1725520908928.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/></p>", "firstLetter": "JRYJ", "imgUrl": null, "importance": 2, "level": 2, "limitUpTimes": 0, "name": "金融硬件", "parentId": 69, "pctChg": -0.5, "reason": "支付设备是指用于处理电子支付的各种硬件和软件工具，如POS机、ATM机、移动支付设备、电子钱包、芯片和PIN终端、在线支付网关以及NFC支付系统，它们使交易更快捷、安全。", "remark": "", "sort": 99, "status": "1", "subjectId": 9032595, "type": 1, "updateBy": null, "updateTime": "2024-10-06 13:33:01"}
